Still 1.2.0. A row of lamps that says where a tap is lost.

Pocket mode shows nine dots, in the order a tap passes them: in, band, hear, floor, marg, atk, fall, tail, tap. Each is lit while that step is passing signal on, so the row stops where your taps are being lost. Also in Diagnostics, above the tap numbers.

And nothing lowers your music any more — ducking is gone from both phones, after it stopped background audio for good on build 184.
